    "manual_proof": "Finite descent makes arrow forest rooted at seeds; unique seed forces connected arborescence and zero forks. Local predecessor condition fully characterizes feasible subsets, proving DP exact. Minimum at1=0 and at.99>0 plus monotonicity/concavity excludes all c<1. Ceiling follows completed square; scalar derivative strictly negative for p>0."
